<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><meta name="theme-color" content="#5e241e"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"><link rel="canonical" href="https://delhigatelahore.com/en/privacy/" /><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://delhigatelahore.com/en/privacy/" /><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ur" href="https://delhigatelahore.com/privacy/" /><title>Privacy</title></head><body><main class="container" style="padding:5rem 0"><h1 style="color:#5e241e;text-shadow:none;font-size:3rem">Privacy</h1><p>This guide has no visitor accounts. The Google Analytics 4 library is requested automatically with a measurement ID. Actual event collection has not been independently verified; when configured and running, it may process page views, device/browser information and cookies under Google’s policies. Embedded Google Maps also contacts Google. Text uses the system font stack; this source does not request remote font files. There is no on-site analytics or hosting-measurement switch. Browser privacy tools may restrict requests or cookies; changing browser settings does not guarantee removal of scripts or all Google cookies. Cloudflare hosts this site and processes technical request and connection data for delivery and security. Hosting edge measurements are separate from GA. Hosting settings may inject a Cloudflare Web Analytics browser beacon for visits, page views and performance, including page/referrer, country, browser, device and operating system when it runs; this is not a claim that a beacon or transmission has been observed on this release. Weather and air-quality panels request Open-Meteo directly using fixed landmark coordinates, not your device location; those providers receive connection data. The panel keeps no persistent weather cache and clears displayed estimates after 15 minutes before refreshing.</p><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo</a></p><p><a href="/en/">← Main page</a> · <a href="/privacy/" hreflang="ur" lang="ur" dir="rtl">اردو</a></p></main></body></html>
